619:/**
620: * Throws a marked Error so a Git-Operations failure propagates out of
621: * action() and the workflow run is RED — the SM (and any human watching
622: * the run list) can tell a dead dev letter from a green one.
623: *
624: * gh-683 (live fa run 37153405587, fa gh-1206..1210, 2026-10-03): the dev
625: * leg did all the work, the staging add died on git's ignored-pathspec
626: * guard, and the leg then posted the error comment, moved the ticket back
627: * to Ready For Development and returned { success: true } — a silent
628: * no-PR loop the conveyor could not see. resetDevelopmentForRetry() has
