661: * as throwGitOperationsFailure (gh-683) and throwPrCreationFailure (gh-729).
662: *
663: * gh-742 (live dmtools-dart gh-350, run 37316571468, 2026-10-05): the CLI
664: * agent was interrupted mid-way — "outputs/response.md missing after commit —
665: * CLI agent was interrupted mid-way. Resetting for retry." — and the leg then
666: * returned { success: true }. The green no-PR leg read as "dev done": the
667: * wrapper armed agent:review on an issue with no PR and no closing
668: * explanation, and no retry ever fired. The interrupted comment + Ready For
669: * Development reset have ALREADY happened before this throws, so the failure
670: * stays retryable; only the run's conclusion changes (green → red), which
671: * keeps the wrapper from reaching its review-arming step.
672: */
